        {
          "id": "f4",
          "label": "Intro paragraph",
          "type": "text",
          "value": "General dentistry is the foundation of lifelong oral health. It focuses on preventing problems before they begin, finding concerns early while they are simpler to manage, and treating everyday dental issues with care. At Precision Dental, we look after patients of all ages, and we take the time to explain your oral health in clear, practical terms."
        },
        {
          "id": "f5",
          "label": "Intro paragraph",
          "type": "text",
          "value": "Regular visits allow us to monitor changes over time, clean away the build-up that brushing cannot reach and give you personalised advice for caring for your teeth at home."
        },
